config BR2_PACKAGE_TCC
	bool "tcc"
	depends on BR2_i386
	help
	  TinyCC: a small, fast C compiler that runs comfortably inside
	  the browser VM. Installs the compiler, its runtime
	  (/usr/lib/tcc) and -- so it can actually compile and link on
	  the target -- the musl and kernel headers plus crt objects
	  from staging.

	  https://bellard.org/tcc/
